---
/* REF: MG-2026-ASTRO-EN-YTB-01 */
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Investment Incentives in Türkiye";
const pageDesc = "Procedural specs for the Turkish Investment Incentive Certificate (YTB), regional subsidy scales, capital thresholds, and close-out audit filings.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDesc}>
  
  <section class="py-xl">
    <div class="ledger-container">
      
      <div class="dossier-box">
        <div class="dossier-header-bar">
          <span class="ref-stamp">REF: MG-2026-EN-SERVICEYTB</span>
          <span class="classification-stamp">[ REGULATORY BRIEFING / TECHNICAL SCOPE ]</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-title-box">
          <span class="sec-number">02/A. INCENTIVES DIRECTORY</span>
          <h1 class="hero-main-title">State Investment Incentives & Dossier Formulations</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Comprehensive administrative scoping and E-TUYS filing management to secure VAT exemptions, customs duty waivers, corporate tax breaks, and social security premium subsidies.</p>
          <hr class="double-rule" />
        </div>

        <!-- Detailed Scoping Matrix -->
        <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-2col">
          <div class="ledger-col ledger-col-split" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-card);">
            <span class="sec-number">01. STATUTORY THRESHOLDS</span>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Capital Limits & Regional Subsidies</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              To qualify for a formal Investment Incentive Certificate (YTB) from the Ministry of Industry and Technology, investments must satisfy strict statutory thresholds:
            </p>
            <ul style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-ink); margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
              <li><strong>Regions 1 & 2 (Developed Zones):</strong> Minimum 3 Million TRY fixed capital setup.</li>
              <li><strong>Regions 3, 4, 5 & 6 (Developing Zones):</strong> Minimum 1.5 Million TRY fixed capital setup.</li>
              <li><strong>Strategic Investments (Nationwide):</strong> Minimum 50 Million TRY fixed capital setup, regardless of geographic location.</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
              Türkiye maps its provinces on a scale of 1 to 6. As the regional index increases, the tax reduction rates, investment contribution ratios, and social security employer share coverage periods scale significantly.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="ledger-col">
            <span class="sec-number">02. PRINCIPAL SUBSIDY ELEMENTS</span>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">Incentive Brackets & Tax Reliefs</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
              Securing a verified Incentive Certificate provides direct B2B fiscal benefits, codified under national legislation:
            </p>
            <table class="matrix-table" style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>SUBSIDY ELEMENT</th>
                  <th>REGULATORY BRACKET / APPLICATION</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>VAT Exemption</strong></td>
                  <td>100% exemption from Value Added Tax on domestic and imported machinery purchases.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Customs Duty Exemption</strong></td>
                  <td>100% waiver of customs tariffs on foreign-sourced capital machinery items.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Corporate Tax Reduction</strong></td>
                  <td>Substantial reduction in standard corporate income tax rates, capped by total investment contributions.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>SGK Employer Premium Support</strong></td>
                  <td>State-funded coverage of social security employer shares for newly created local staff slots.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Interest Rate Subsidy</strong></td>
                  <td>Ministry-backed coverage of commercial credit interest points on eligible capital loans.</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="double-rule" style="margin: 25px 0;"></div>

        <!-- Services Scope list -->
        <div class="process-scope-section">
          <span class="sec-number">03. PROCEDURAL STAGES & LIAISON PROTOCOLS</span>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Dossier Scoping & Administrative Lifecycles</h3>
          
          <div class="ledger-row ledger-row-2col" style="border: none; margin-bottom: 0;">
            <div class="ledger-col ledger-col-split" style="padding-right: var(--space-md);">
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">1. Scoping, Feasibility & Environmental Verification</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
                We analyze your planned machinery lists, verify sector suitability, and coordinate statutory prerequisites, including trade chamber registry mappings and E-TUYS portal authorizations.
              </p>
              
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">2. Ministry Filing & Application Management</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
                We draft and organize all technical projections, process lists, and financial ratios under E-TUYS framework parameters. We act as your liaison to address Ministry requests and file amendments.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="ledger-col" style="padding-left: var(--space-md);">
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">3. Machinery List Revisions & Timeline Extensions</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
                Capital requirements fluctuate during project executions. We submit subsequent machinery list amendments, domestic-to-import shifts, and official document extension requests to prevent compliance halts.
              </p>
              
              <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">4. Close-Out Audit (Completion Visa)</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
                Once the investment period terminates, we organize the mandatory on-site expert panel audit, verify total active machinery expenditures against tescil records, and secure the formal Completion Visa.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="double-rule" style="margin: 25px 0;"></div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 25px;">
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">Initiate Your Investment Scoping</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Book a structured 30-minute Initial Advisory Session with our managing partner to map out your state incentive path.</p>
          <a href="/en/advisory/" class="btn btn-primary">BOOK INITIAL ADVISORY SESSION</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
